21T16:10:15+00:00","h":"mollieewalkerr.bsky.social","o":"New York Post","t":"Some more updates out of practice⬇️\n\n- Both Oliver Bjorkstrand and Alberts Šmits are out 2-3 months with upper-body injuries\n- Luke Glendening will be placed on waivers today\n- New addition Max Sasson is participating in practice","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/mollieewalkerr.bsky.social/post/3n2tigehohc2n"},{"a":"Daniel Wagner","d":"2026-11-21T02:10:28+00:00","h":"passittobulis.bsky.social","o":"Pass it to Bulis","t":"The Sasson trade feels like that old writing — or, really, editing — advice: \"Kill your darlings.\"\n\nSasson was a great guy, a great story, and a great find for the scouting staff. But you can't be too precious about players who aren't part of the future when you're rebuilding.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/passittobulis.bsky.social/post/3n2rzipjy7k2j"},{"a":"Daniel Wagner","d":"2026-11-21T00:08:28+00:00","h":"passittobulis.bsky.social","o":"Pass it to Bulis","t":"Trading a fourth-line forward for a mid-round pick while you're in a rebuild makes sense every time.\n\nBut the timing of the Max Sasson trade is a little bit odd in almost every way. #Canucks dailyhive.com/vancouver/ca...","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/passittobulis.bsky.social/post/3n2rsokl3gc2j"},{"a":"Wyatt Arndt","d":"2026-11-20T23:38:55+00:00","h":"stanch.bsky.social","o":"CanucksArmy","t":"Theory: Max Sasson got traded because he organized the summit at a chiptoles instead of a Canucks sponsor. \n\nShould have held it in the frozen section at Save On.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stanch.bsky.social/post/3n2rqzozluk24"},{"a":"Mollie Walker","d":"2026-11-20T23:15:36+00:00","h":"mollieewalkerr.bsky.social","o":"New York Post","t":"The Rangers acquire 26-year-old center Max Sasson from the Canucks in exchange for a fourth-round pick in 2029.\n\nMuch-needed center who will also contribute on the PK.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/mollieewalkerr.bsky.social/post/3n2rppzlrcc2j"},{"a":"Daniel Wagner","d":"2026-11-20T04:59:14+00:00","h":"passittobulis.bsky.social","o":"Pass it to Bulis","t":"Have to feel bad for Gallagher. He was really starting to find his stride alongside Drew O'Connor and Max Sasson. #Canucks","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/passittobulis.bsky.social/post/3n2pshkggqs22"}],"team":"VAN","threads":[],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-16T22:00:16+00:00","id":"Lfcmr4n3lPE","k":"presser","t":"Mic'd Up | Max Sasson vs. Philadelphia Flyers (Nov 9, 2026)","team":"VAN","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lfcmr4n3lPE"},{"d":"2026-11-08T06:12:46+00:00","id":"Pvx4oJa3Qzk","k":"presser","t":"Max Sasson & Manny Malhotra Postgame Media | Vancouver Canucks at Edmonton Oilers (Nov 7, 2026)","team":"VAN","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pvx4oJa3Qzk"},{"d":"2026-11-01T02:18:51+00:00","id":"JIqUpqKpQqU","k":"presser","t":"Brock Boeser, Max Sasson & Manny Malhotra Postgame Media | Canucks vs Maple Leafs (Oct 31, 2026)","team":"VAN","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JIqUpqKpQqU"},{"d":"2026-10-21T05:21:08+00:00","id":"eDdtN27BD20","k":"presser","t":"Elias Pettersson, Max Sasson & Manny Malhotra Postgame Media | Canucks vs. Hurricanes (Oct 20 2026)","team":"VAN","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDdtN27BD20"}]}